### admin login
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "password"}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### create client
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "partner-a", "scopes": ["orders.read"]}

> {%
  client.global.set("clientId", response.body.client.clientId);
  client.global.set("clientSecret", response.body.clientSecret);
%}

### create client (private_key_jwt, registered public key)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "partner-c", "scopes": ["service-a"], "authMethod": "PUBLIC_KEY", "publicKey": "-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----\nMIIBIjANBg...\n-----END PUBLIC KEY-----"}

### client credentials token (private_key_jwt)
POST http://localhost:8080/oauth2/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&scope=service-a&client_id={{clientId}}&client_assertion_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:client-assertion-type:jwt-bearer&client_assertion={{clientAssertion}}

### list clients
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### get client
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/clients/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### client credentials token (client_secret_post)
POST http://localhost:8080/oauth2/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&scope=orders.read&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

> {% client.global.set("clientToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### granted scope, 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### not granted scope, 403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### delete client
DELETE http://localhost:8080/admin/clients/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
